ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models
Project Planning
1. Project Planning Overview
ComicCraft is planned as an AI-powered comic creation system that uses Gemini models to transform a user's basic story idea into a structured comic containing characters, scenes, panels, dialogue, narration, and visuals.
The project will be developed in stages so that the core comic-generation workflow is completed first, followed by editing, storage, testing, and export features.
________________________________________
2. Project Goals
The main goals are:
•	Build an easy-to-use AI comic creation platform.
•	Integrate Gemini models for story generation.
•	Automatically create characters and scenes.
•	Generate panel-by-panel comic content.
•	Provide users with an interactive editing experience.
•	Maintain consistency across characters and scenes.
•	Save and manage comic projects.
•	Provide a final comic preview and export option.
