13. Testing Plan
Testing should be performed throughout development rather than only at the end.
Unit Testing
Test individual components:
•	Authentication
•	Story generation
•	Character generation
•	Panel generation
•	Database operations
•	Export functions
Integration Testing
Test interactions between:
Frontend ↔ Backend
Backend ↔ Gemini
Backend ↔ Database
Backend ↔ Storage
UI Testing
Verify:
•	Buttons
•	Forms
•	Navigation
•	Editor
•	Responsive layout
•	Error messages
AI Testing
Test different prompts and verify:
•	Story relevance
•	Character consistency
•	Dialogue quality
•	Panel structure
•	Response format
•	Handling of invalid/empty prompts
User Acceptance Testing
Allow sample users to create comics and collect feedback on:
•	Ease of use
•	Generation quality
•	Editing experience
•	Performance
•	Overall workflow
