16. Risk Management
Risk	Impact	Mitigation
Gemini API failure	High	Error handling and retry mechanism
API quota limitations	High	Usage monitoring and efficient prompts
Inconsistent characters	Medium	Character Bible and persistent descriptions
Poor AI output	Medium	Structured prompts and validation
Slow generation	Medium	Generate panels individually and use loading states
Data loss	High	Auto-save and database backups
Image-generation limitations	Medium	Keep artwork generation modular
Security issues	High	Server-side secrets and authentication
